      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْسٌ نَاتِرَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A bow that breaks its string, by
reason of its hardness:</i> (S, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَاتِرُ</span>: (S:)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِسِىٌّ نَوَاتِرُ</span> signifies <i>bows having the strings
broken.</i> (M.)

